zortui
======

zortui is our copy of the Zig port of hqtui (ports/zig in
https://github.com/profullstack/hqtui), maintained independently.

The original work is by the hqtui authors and is released under the MIT
License; that license and its copyright notice are reproduced in LICENSE and
apply to this repository. The git history of ports/zig is preserved here, so
every upstream commit keeps its original author.

